WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:04.761
See who does not follow you back on Instagram, without giving any app your

2
00:00:04.761 --> 00:00:05.231
password.

3
00:00:06.731 --> 00:00:10.672
Why unfollower apps get accounts locked, how to download your own followers

4
00:00:10.672 --> 00:00:13.877
and following lists, and how to compare them in your browser.

5
00:00:15.277 --> 00:00:19.479
Why the login apps are risky. Instagram has no public way for another app

6
00:00:19.479 --> 00:00:20.803
to read your followers.

7
00:00:22.103 --> 00:00:26.459
Ask Instagram for your lists. Open Instagram, go to Accounts Center, then

8
00:00:26.459 --> 00:00:30.337
Your information and permissions, then Download your information.

9
00:00:31.637 --> 00:00:36.038
How the comparison works. Once you have both lists, the rest is simple set

10
00:00:36.038 --> 00:00:36.395
logic.

11
00:00:37.695 --> 00:00:39.868
The same idea works for other apps.

12
00:00:39.868 --> 00:00:44.586
Almost every app has a download your data page now, and the files are always

13
00:00:44.586 --> 00:00:46.697
the same mix of ZIP, JSON and CSV.

14
00:00:47.997 --> 00:00:51.428
To try it, open Instagram Followers Checker in OpenFile.

15
00:00:51.428 --> 00:00:54.921
Drop in a file, adjust the settings and press the button.

16
00:00:54.921 --> 00:00:58.045
It all runs on your device, so nothing is uploaded.

17
00:01:01.097 --> 00:01:04.575
Read the full post, with live demos, on the OpenFile blog.
